{"type":"message","id":"04029f43","parentId":"28425150","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:01:53.647Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST is returning error 1101 which seems to be a Cloudflare error (possibly 1101 is some kind of Workers error). The GET requests work fine but POST doesn't. Let me try to understand what error 1101 means. In Cloudflare Workers, error 1101 is \"Worker threw an exception\" - meaning the POST handler is throwing an error. The Workers function probably has a bug.\n\nLet me try with a simpler message to see if the issue is with the content.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-96ced697-d8ac-48e1-98ee-c6e609a900fb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 16:00 UTC test\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat 16:00 UTC test\\\"}'\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17495,"output":198,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17789,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779292907178,"responseId":"chatcmpl-047c37dc-d72f-47b6-9712-b36ab20dbf30"}}
