{"type":"message","id":"4554f195","parentId":"b59f7c50","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:02:10.445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST requests are failing with error 1101 (which is likely a Cloudflare error). The GET requests work fine. Let me try a different approach - maybe the API requires a different method or the POST endpoint is temporarily unavailable.\n\nError code 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Worker exception\" - the worker itself is throwing an exception. This might be a bug in the worker's /send endpoint, or the worker is out of resources.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成 (16:00 UTC)**\n\n## 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 19) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC (May 19) | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n所有最新消息均为机器心跳报告，双线程无新增人类讨论无需响应。\n\n**⚠️ 异常情况：** POST /send 端点返回 Cloudflare Worker 异常 (error code 1101 — Worker exception)，GET /history 正常工作。可能原因：\n1. Worker 资源配额耗尽\n2. /send 端点存在代码异常\n\n建议通知平台维护者检查 Worker 日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7292,"output":263,"cacheRead":10416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17971,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779292913896,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9a374a25-77ce-40d0-8974-079d77a83ff5"}}
